# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Proprietary Voxin / IBM ViaVoice payloads. These are licensed binaries and
# must NEVER be committed. work/ is where the install flow expects the
# archive, and the pattern rules catch a stray copy anywhere else in the
# tree. A pre-commit hook (.githooks/) backs this up.
work/*
!work/.gitkeep
*voxin*.tar.*
*voxin*.tgz
*.txz
voxin-installer*
rfs_*.tar*
rfs32/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local build and test logs
build.log
baremetal-test.log
*.log

# Editor and OS noise
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
